<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/registry/new-york-v4/charts/chart-bar-multiple.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="bar-chart" data-kv-variant="grouped" data-klic-component="bar-chart" class="kn-bar-chart"><header data-part="heading"><strong>분기별 달성</strong><p data-part="muted">진한 막대: 실적 · 옅은 막대: 목표</p></header><div data-part="bars bars-grouped"><div><strong>1분기</strong><div><span style="height:40px" title="실적 40" data-part="bar"></span><span style="height:80px" title="목표 80" data-part="bar bar-light"></span></div><small>40 / 80</small></div><div><strong>2분기</strong><div><span style="height:62px" title="실적 62" data-part="bar"></span><span style="height:80px" title="목표 80" data-part="bar bar-light"></span></div><small>62 / 80</small></div><div><strong>3분기</strong><div><span style="height:78px" title="실적 78" data-part="bar"></span><span style="height:80px" title="목표 80" data-part="bar bar-light"></span></div><small>78 / 80</small></div></div></div>
